<p>
<md>P(X=0).</md>
</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Use the PGF of a binomial variable to compute its mean.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Use PGF derivatives to derive the variance of a Poisson variable.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Find the MGF of a Bernoulli random variable.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Find the MGF of a binomial random variable.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Find the MGF of a Poisson random variable.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Find the MGF of</p>

<p>
<md>X\sim\operatorname{Exp}(\lambda).</md>
</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

