<p>
<md>X\sim\operatorname{Exp}(\lambda).</md>
</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Show that</p>

<p>
<md>G_X'(1)
=
\mathbb{E}[X].</md>
</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Show that</p>

<p>
<md>G_X''(1)
=
\mathbb{E}[X(X-1)].</md>
</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Derive the variance formula</p>

<p>
<md>\operatorname{Var}(X)
=
G_X''(1)
+
G_X'(1)
-
[G_X'(1)]^2.</md>
</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Use PGFs to show that the sum of independent binomial variables with
common success probability <m>p</m> is binomial.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Use PGFs to prove that the sum of independent Poisson random variables
is Poisson.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
