about zero is real-valued.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Prove that</p>

<p>
<md>M_{aX+b}(t)
=
e^{bt}M_X(at).</md>
</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Prove that</p>

<p>
<md>\varphi_{aX+b}(t)
=
e^{ibt}\varphi_X(at).</md>
</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>For a Poisson variable, derive all cumulants from the cumulant generating
function.</p>
</statement>
